lee-kum-kee-sesame-oil-207ml.description:
Made from the best roasted sesame seeds, this Pure Sesame Oil is carefully processed to retain its strong sesame flavour and is indispensable in many dishes. To accent overall taste, add a few dashes just before serving or when marinating meat.
- Made with all natural ingredients;
- No Added Additives;
- Vegetarians & Vegans suitable

lee-kum-kee-ready-sauce-chicken-honey-so.description:
Cantonese cuisine is famous for its delicate, well-balanced flavours which enhance the freshness of the ingredients. Now you can enjoy the perfect combination of sweet and savoury with Lee Kum Kee Ready Sauce for Honey & Soy Chicken.
- Gluten Free;
- No Added Preservatives;
- Suitable for Vegetarians

lee-kk-sce-soy-premium-500ml.description:
Lee Kum Kee Premium Soy Sauce is made from soybeans and wheat flour. It is brewed according to the traditional method. It has a rich soy flavour, colour and aroma which will delicately enhance the taste of any dish. Use it as a meat marinade, a dipping sauce, and seasoning.
- Naturally brewed;
- Made with non-GM soybeans;
- No Added Additives (Preservatives, Colourings, Flavourings)
- Vegetarian & Vegans suitable
- Authentic Chinese taste

lee-kk-sce-oyster-255g.description:
Made with selected oyster extract, Lee Kum Kee Panda Brand Oyster Sauce is an all-purpose seasoning sauce that has an earthy, sweet-salty taste. It is perfect to be used as a marinade, dipping or stir-fry sauce.
- No Artificial Oyster Flavourings Added;
- No Added Preservatives;
- Perfect for Stir-Fry;
- Authentic Chinese taste

